 # run nightly and on demand (workflow_dispatch).
 # build: JaCoCo floors halt `mvn verify` (root pom), ci/coverage_check.py refuses a decrease beyond
 # the 2 pp noise band (D-029) against the baseline committed at the previous main commit. bench: bench/run.sh (P0-10) exits
